# Chatbot source of truth

The embedded **Proxy** UI in the portfolio iframe is a **pre-built static app** from GitHub, not the local Vite tree.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| [Srini93/srini-chatbot](https://github.com/Srini93/srini-chatbot) | **Source of the live Proxy UI** — production build at repo root (`index.html`, `assets/`, `sw.js`). |
| `chatbot/` | **Deploy copy** served by the portfolio iframe (`data-chatbot-src="./chatbot/"`). Synced from that GitHub repo with relative path fixes. |
| `srini-chatbot/` | **Legacy Vite app** (older UI). Do not treat this as Proxy source. |

## Rules

1. **Do not run** `cd srini-chatbot && npm run build` to “update Proxy”. Vite `emptyOutDir: true` **deletes** `chatbot/` and replaces Proxy with the old app.
2. **To refresh Proxy**, clone/copy from `https://github.com/Srini93/srini-chatbot` into `chatbot/`, then rewrite root-absolute URLs for the iframe subpath:
   - `/assets/…` → `./assets/…` in `chatbot/index.html` and `chatbot/assets/manifest.webmanifest`
   - `register("/sw.js")` → `register("./sw.js")`
   - Manifest `start_url` / `scope` / `id`: `/` → `./`
3. **Never hand-edit** minified files under `chatbot/assets/` except those path rewrites after a sync.
4. **Portfolio pages** only embed via `#chatbot-sidebar` + `data-chatbot-src="./chatbot/"`. Host CSS/JS for sidebar, FAB, and iframe loader is allowed. After a Proxy sync, bump `CHATBOT_CACHE_BUST` (and `PP_CHAT_CACHE_BUST` in `password-protect.js`).
5. UI/logic changes for the **current Proxy** belong in the GitHub repo, not in `srini-chatbot/src/**`, unless that tree is explicitly replaced with the GitHub source.

## What you may change on host pages

- `#chatbot-sidebar` attributes (`data-chatbot-src`, `data-chat-api`)
- Host CSS for sidebar width, FAB, `body.chat-open` layout
- Host JS for iframe lazy-load, `postMessage` close, API URL resolution
